# Generated programs. `gen-semipersistence.py` reproduces them byte for byte from
# the pinned seed; only the smallest size is committed, because the full set is
# 87 MB. `gen-calc.py` cuts the calc prefixes from the two committed sources.
sp-t2650.*.egg
sp-t8900.*.egg
sp-t27000.*.egg
sp-t100000.*.egg
calc.*-p[0-9].egg
*.stats.json
